  "tagline": "Shake the cubes. Find the words nobody else found.",
  "description": "Sixteen letter cubes tumble onto the TV. Everyone hunts the same grid on their phone, tracing words through touching letters. Words only you found score; words someone else also found score nothing. Three rounds, and the longest word gets the spotlight.",
